<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκην-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at</i> or <i>before the
				tent</i>, i.e. <i>public</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					579
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐ</span>. <i>the soldiers quartered</i>
			(in the towns), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρχ.Ἐφ</span>.<i><span class="en">
				1917.2
			</span></i>; cf. sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<i>on the stage</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ</span>.,
			as Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισκήνιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				5.6.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>.
				<i>external, adventitious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκηνα, τά</span>,
			festival at Sparta, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
